Subete no hajimari no akashi

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Hikaru sora no hate

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
Yume wa mada maboroshi

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Tsuki no akari kage ouyouni hashiru kono michi

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
