00:23:32.720 --> 00:23:48.170
EPISODE 20
THERE WERE
WAVES

00:23:33.950 --> 00:23:37.220
I know Yojiro is somewhere out there.

00:23:37.220 --> 00:23:42.560
Right. Yojiro will never die.
No, it won't let him die.

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:46.860
His destiny as the Eternal Assassin won't let him.

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:53.440
I've never once cursed my own destiny.
I've never hated or despised it... Not even once.

00:23:48.170 --> 00:24:02.570
THERE WERE
WAVES

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:57.810
It was always in front of me like it was
supposed to be... Just like this katana.

00:23:57.980 --> 00:24:00.440
What? Akizuki-sama?!
